Task 1 — Predict salary from experience
Data to use
years = [[1], [2], [3], [4], [5], [6], [7], [8]]
salary = [30000, 35000, 40000, 45000, 50000, 60000, 65000, 70000]
What your program must do
1. Import LinearRegression
2. Split data into train/test
3. Train model
4. Predict salary for 9 years experience
5. Print prediction
Expected idea
Input: 9 years
Output: around 75000+
X = inputs/features
y = output/target

